── UNKNOWN NAME ─────────────────────── E0211_rust_println_macro.lt:3:3  [E0211]

Stilt has no `println!`: `print` is a function, called as `print("…")`:

  3 │   println!("hello, {name}")
    │   ^^^^^^^

`print` writes its string and a newline. A string shows a value inside braces,
as `"total: {n}"`.

To fix it, call `print`:

  3 │   print("hello, {name}")
    │   ~~~~~
